  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/vm0gS2JD/Image-5.png\" width=\"409\" height=\"424\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DNt5seNA3C\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1206208925590884352.svg?label=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=flat\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#d40931\"><strong>一種輕量級的方式，讓你的《Minecraft》體驗更加<span style=\"font-size:18px\">「血腥」！</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">  </span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組會在生物實體於特定情況下受傷時，為<span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\"><strong>所有生物實體</strong></span>添加<span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\"><strong>血粒子</strong></span>！它同時兼容 99% 的<span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\"><strong>模組實體</strong></span>與<span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><strong>玩家實體</strong></strong></span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/zXsGnF9d/Image-2.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"343\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組內建深度系統，可根據<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>實體的已損失生命值</strong></span>來調整<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>粒子大小比例</strong></span>與<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>粒子數量</strong></span>，並會依據對實體造成的傷害量來擴大其<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>擴散範圍</strong></span>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">粒子在空中時會以一般粒子形式渲染，但一旦觸及表面，就會<strong>平鋪附著</strong>其上，包含<strong>水面</strong>！若擊中方塊底部或側邊附近，渲染方式將有所不同，會在掉落至地面之前呈現<strong>震動狀態</strong>（模擬滴落效果）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/nr6pGnws/Image-3.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"343\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">你只需開啟模組專屬的<strong>設定檔</strong>（extragore-property.toml），即可輕鬆自訂<strong>輸出粒子的顏色</strong>！該檔案提供直觀易懂的選項，讓你為任何實體設定偏好的顏色！</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr style=\"border:2px solid #d40931\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>你好！喜歡這個模組的話，我還有幾個你可能也會感興趣！😊</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-interaction-disabler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/JhMz01hW/Icon-7.gif\" alt=\"物品互動禁用模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/burning-furnace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/vZ6VfHMg/Icon-2.gif\" alt=\"燃燒熔爐模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brew-chew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PJrDwWrT/Icon-1.gif\" alt=\"釀嚼模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lit-it-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/9MfXPJT8/Icon-8.gif\" alt=\"燃亮模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/burn-it-all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/L5bJgGb3/Icon-3.gif\" alt=\"焚燒一切模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-mo-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/YqFrx4GH/Icon-10.gif\" alt=\"無傳送門模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miner-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/PxFXSYQt/Icon-9.gif\" alt=\"礦工村民模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experimental-settings-disabler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Fz7RvDHd/Icon-4.gif\" alt=\"實驗性設定禁用模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-color-codes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/gkLJBS71/Icon-5.gif\" alt=\"額外顏色代碼模組\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>",
